1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 5]

34
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:49,230
After entering the capital,
Longsheng's escort guards

35
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,800
stay at Sheng'an Inn.

36
00:01:51,510 --> 00:01:52,760
It looks like a routine escort,

37
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:53,620
but in fact,

38
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:55,530
they're helping Chen Daohua
smuggle blood jade out of the city.

39
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:56,340
I see.

40
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:57,800
Keep an eye on them.

41
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,520
Come sit down.

42
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,710
I have something to say.

43
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:17,830
Go ahead.

44
00:02:19,190 --> 00:02:19,620
Sir,

45
00:02:22,310 --> 00:02:23,890
the Fengyi Bureau selection
is next month.

46
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:27,080
Please let me enter.

47
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:28,710
I've told you.

48
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:29,960
You're not eligible.

49
00:02:30,290 --> 00:02:31,560
Please give me a chance.

50
00:02:37,750 --> 00:02:39,570
So Pei Zhao really is here
for the rebels.

51
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:42,750
The rebels have grown in recent years,

52
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,700
but causing such a major incident

53
00:02:44,710 --> 00:02:45,840
at the Blood Jade Mine

54
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,760
wouldn't have been easy.

55
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,360
There may be an inside man.

56
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:51,280
Keep watch for now.

57
00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:54,870
That woman's actions just now

58
00:02:54,870 --> 00:02:56,080
were rather interesting.

59
00:02:56,930 --> 00:02:59,040
Pei Zhao has led the Fengyi Bureau

60
00:02:59,060 --> 00:02:59,960
for seven years,

61
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,880
and that's the first time
he was knocked down.

62
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,520
And by a woman, no less.

63
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,910
She's fierce.

64
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:06,360
I'm afraid one day...

65
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:06,980
That's bravery.

66
00:03:11,350 --> 00:03:11,740
Let's go.

67
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,360
It's all fighting from here.

68
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:15,400
Nothing worth watching.

69
00:03:19,670 --> 00:03:21,280
How is she so strong?

70
00:03:22,530 --> 00:03:23,960
She did it to protect you.

71
00:03:29,150 --> 00:03:30,520
Sir, do you

72
00:03:30,670 --> 00:03:31,710
have feelings for Madam Xu?

73
00:03:31,870 --> 00:03:32,690
Nonsense.

74
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:37,190
I've been by your side for seven years.

75
00:03:37,870 --> 00:03:38,880
I can tell

76
00:03:39,490 --> 00:03:40,710
what you're thinking.

77
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:44,570
You joined the Fengyi Bureau at 14.

78
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:47,350
With three strikes,
you routed 300 rebels.

79
00:03:47,970 --> 00:03:49,680
Fengyi Guard hailed you as a legend.

80
00:03:55,220 --> 00:03:57,140
[Young Pei Zhao]

81
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,220
It took you ten years
to secure your position.

82
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,960
His Majesty holds you in high regard.

83
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:02,420
Even your marriage

84
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,990
isn't yours to decide.

85
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,240
And you've made many enemies
over the years.

86
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,960
They may not be able to hurt you,

87
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,260
but they can hurt a defenseless woman.

88
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:16,390
Madam Xu has suffered since childhood.

89
00:04:16,830 --> 00:04:18,180
She barely escaped with her life.

90
00:04:19,270 --> 00:04:20,160
I think

91
00:04:21,230 --> 00:04:22,650
we should keep her out of this.

92
00:04:24,310 --> 00:04:25,390
You're overthinking it.

93
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,090
I'm using her as bait

94
00:04:27,290 --> 00:04:28,540
to draw out whoever implanted the Gu.

95
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:29,950
As for this mother-child Gu,

96
00:04:29,950 --> 00:04:30,870
even if it has to be cut out of me,

97
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:31,700
I do not fear at all.

98
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:33,930
Yes.

99
00:04:36,810 --> 00:04:37,360
Sir.

100
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:37,900
We caught them downstairs.

101
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,000
You scum.

102
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,790
One day,

103
00:04:46,810 --> 00:04:48,630
the Bloodslayer Army will kill you.

104
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:50,350
Bloodslayer Army?

105
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,670
The rebel army chose a fine name.

106
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:53,560
Sir.

107
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:56,720
Sir.

108
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,600
We found some of the rebels' ledgers.

109
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,270
Let go.

110
00:05:12,110 --> 00:05:13,190
Who told you to act?

111
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:14,630
Do that again,

112
00:05:14,630 --> 00:05:15,480
and you're out of the Fengyi Bureau!

113
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:28,720
Madam Xu, don't be upset.

114
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,450
He just

115
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:31,940
has a bit of a temper.

116
00:05:32,450 --> 00:05:33,830
I'll take you out for buns tonight.

117
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:34,750
They're really good.

118
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,000
Thank you, Chang'an.

119
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,830
It's nothing.

120
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:41,960
Sir.

121
00:05:46,650 --> 00:05:47,420
If you let her go,

122
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:49,420
the mother-child Gu can't
be separated just yet.

123
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,180
If you keep her here,

124
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,230
your life will be tied to hers.

125
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:56,800
If anything happens to her now,

126
00:05:57,130 --> 00:05:59,050
forget using her as bait
to draw out whoever implanted the Gu.

127
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,360
Even your life would be in danger.

128
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,970
So keep a close watch on her.

129
00:06:02,970 --> 00:06:03,980
Nothing must happen to her.

130
00:06:04,810 --> 00:06:06,800
We must find whoever implanted the Gu.

131
00:06:07,430 --> 00:06:08,000
Sir.

132
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:13,900
Sir,

133
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,060
we can't delay this any longer.

134
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,100
There's a Gu master in Nanshan

135
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:18,860
who knows how to remove Gu.

136
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,160
Once this is over,

137
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,030
I'll leave at once

138
00:06:21,830 --> 00:06:23,100
and bring him over to remove your Gu.

139
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:25,390
All right.

140
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:26,420
Sir.

141
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,190
Sir.

142
00:06:28,550 --> 00:06:29,920
More Blood Jade was found
in the secret room.

143
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:31,990
Sir.

144
00:06:38,430 --> 00:06:39,040
Lu Li.

145
00:06:39,550 --> 00:06:40,770
Prepare the closing report at once.

146
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:44,000
Send it to the palace for His Majesty.

147
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,750
Say the rebels were behind this.

148
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:46,480
Yes, sir.

149
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:53,720
Where is she?

150
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:57,770
Madam Xu said her hand hurt,
so she left.

151
00:06:58,350 --> 00:06:59,200
She told you that?

152
00:06:59,690 --> 00:07:00,240
Yes.

153
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:01,480
Sir,

154
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:03,240
Madam Xu is already hurt.

155
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,870
Please do not scold her.

156
00:07:05,430 --> 00:07:05,870
Go.

157
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:07,060
Get back to work.

158
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:08,800
Sir.

159
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,160
To be fair,

160
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:11,480
the Fengyi Bureau always

161
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,220
rewards the worthy
and punishes the guilty.

162
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,410
Madam Xu saved the ledgers
from the fire.

163
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,360
She ought to be commended.

164
00:07:19,030 --> 00:07:20,680
How fair of you.

165
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,100
Thank you, sir.

166
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,280
I try.

167
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,580
How fair of you.

168
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:58,870
Fengyi Guard protects the weak?

169
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:00,670
Liar.

170
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:36,500
Stop it.

171
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:37,930
Sir,

172
00:08:39,070 --> 00:08:40,250
are you feeling unwell?

173
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:41,810
Should I get a physician?

174
00:08:47,630 --> 00:08:48,510
I said stop.

175
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:49,670
Stop pinching it.

176
00:08:50,590 --> 00:08:51,990
Sir, if I don't,

177
00:08:52,370 --> 00:08:53,370
I can't put the medicine on.

178
00:08:54,390 --> 00:08:55,810
I'll get a physician to do it.

179
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:56,820
No need.

180
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:57,980
I'll do it myself.

181
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:00,750
Wait.

182
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:03,760
You...

183
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:05,860
You heard that, didn't you?

184
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:08,770
Yes.

185
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:10,840
If you don't want it to hurt,

186
00:09:12,270 --> 00:09:14,240
give me a chance to take the selection.

187
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,550
You're bargaining with me?

188
00:09:17,550 --> 00:09:18,840
I just want one chance.

189
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,240
If I fail,

190
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:21,440
I'll never bother you about it again.

191
00:09:21,750 --> 00:09:23,030
I'm telling you one last time.

192
00:09:23,470 --> 00:09:24,430
Absolutely not.

193
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,320
Fine.

194
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:33,960
Are you crazy?

195
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,840
I only got this mother-child Gu

196
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,030
because of you.

197
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,240
They're trying to kill you.

198
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,110
What does that have to do with me?

199
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:40,000
And you want to use me as bait

200
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,130
to draw out the people behind this?

201
00:09:41,650 --> 00:09:43,200
You led me to that cave at the mine.

202
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,510
Of course this concerns you.

203
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:46,360
You know this has nothing to do with me,

204
00:09:46,670 --> 00:09:47,710
yet you're still blaming me.

205
00:09:48,630 --> 00:09:48,910
You...

206
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:49,870
Let go.

207
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:52,440
I was wrong about you.

208
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,790
You're the Chief Commander
of the Fengyi Guard,

209
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:56,370
yet all you do is use innocent women.

210
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,940
You're a petty little man.

211
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:00,780
Let go.

212
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,240
I...

213
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,560
We need a proper cleaning.

214
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:28,950
Right.

215
00:10:28,950 --> 00:10:29,550
Definitely.

216
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:31,360
Are there mosquitoes?

217
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,790
Perhaps Madam Xu could
make some incense to...

218
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,240
What are you doing here?

219
00:10:35,550 --> 00:10:36,820
Go write the closing report.

220
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:38,590
How?

221
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,230
Don't worry. I can do it.

222
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,810
The rebels caused the trouble.

223
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:42,790
All have been brought to justice.

224
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,360
Let's go.

225
00:10:57,890 --> 00:10:58,440
Put it on yourself.

226
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,850
I don't need it.

227
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,690
I want to take the selection exam.

228
00:11:03,740 --> 00:11:04,860
I'm telling you one last time.

229
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,130
Absolutely not.

230
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,980
Once Chen Daohua's case is closed,

231
00:11:08,930 --> 00:11:09,460
I'll send you away.

232
00:11:13,140 --> 00:11:15,740
[Blood Jade Mine Garrison Camp]

233
00:11:27,390 --> 00:11:28,120
General.

234
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:29,630
Pei Zhao's

235
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:32,730
[Zhu Yi, Chief Astrologer]
submitted the report to His Majesty.

236
00:11:33,910 --> 00:11:34,790
We have witnesses

237
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:36,410
and evidence.

238
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,790
That proves

239
00:11:37,890 --> 00:11:40,170
the rebels were behind it.

240
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:41,580
Now,

241
00:11:42,090 --> 00:11:44,610
Longsheng's been shut down,

242
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:47,520
and many rebel accomplices have
been arrested.

243
00:11:47,970 --> 00:11:50,480
You killed the Wingless
to win over the rebels,

244
00:11:50,580 --> 00:11:53,380
then used Pei Zhao to wipe them out.

245
00:11:53,730 --> 00:11:55,320
A fine way to kill two birds.

246
00:11:56,950 --> 00:11:58,400
They say Pei Zhao is formidable.

247
00:11:58,870 --> 00:11:59,690
But from what I see,

248
00:11:59,990 --> 00:12:02,100
he cannot defy those above him.

249
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:04,370
His Majesty

250
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:06,250
is getting old.

251
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,410
In days to come,

252
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:09,780
he must rely on the Noble Consort.

253
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,200
That good-for-nothing

254
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:15,510
used the imperial

255
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:17,510
blood-jade ruler

256
00:12:17,510 --> 00:12:19,200
to humiliate me in front of everyone.

257
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:20,670
I'll find a chance

258
00:12:21,070 --> 00:12:23,520
to pay him back tenfold.

259
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:24,200
General,

260
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:25,250
don't be angry.

261
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:28,840
Your good fortune is yet to come.

262
00:12:29,630 --> 00:12:30,730
The Noble Consort

263
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:34,000
thinks very highly of you.

264
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:35,070
This

265
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:38,170
is her reward for you.

266
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,360
I thank the Noble Consort.

267
00:12:41,070 --> 00:12:42,790
I shall give my all

268
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:44,200
in loyal service to her.

269
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:47,480
We're on the same side.

270
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,660
Come. Let's drink.

271
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,270
Bottoms up.

272
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:01,900
This is...

273
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:09,840
Well...

274
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:12,860
It's...

275
00:13:12,870 --> 00:13:13,950
Just a small token.

276
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,080
Please accept it.

277
00:13:17,570 --> 00:13:19,240
How could I?

278
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,320
We're friends.

279
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,150
Drop the courtesy.

280
00:13:23,270 --> 00:13:23,850
These

281
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,080
were made from

282
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,360
scraps from the mine.

283
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:28,510
If you don't take them,

284
00:13:28,510 --> 00:13:29,720
they'll only be thrown into a pit.

285
00:13:30,030 --> 00:13:31,030
What a waste.

286
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:34,900
Such a waste.

287
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:37,040
You're right.

288
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:39,350
Well, in that case,

289
00:13:40,370 --> 00:13:42,120
I'll accept them for now.

290
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,330
I'll keep them safe

291
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:45,240
for you, General.

292
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,200
That's more like it.

293
00:13:47,250 --> 00:13:48,420
Come on.

294
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,240
A toast to you, General.

295
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:50,770
Come on.

296
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:52,670
Drink up.

297
00:13:53,900 --> 00:13:55,460
[Fengyi Bureau]

298
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,390
Chen Daohua

299
00:13:56,390 --> 00:13:57,620
did have dealings with the Yun family.

300
00:13:57,960 --> 00:14:00,150
He may have other court allies.

301
00:14:00,810 --> 00:14:02,280
The commander guarding Blood Jade Mine

302
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,710
must not consort with court officials.

303
00:14:04,980 --> 00:14:06,680
Chen Daohua was transferred from Jizhou

304
00:14:07,220 --> 00:14:08,620
to the Blood Jade Mine three years ago.

305
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:11,170
How did he get involved with the Yuns?

306
00:14:11,750 --> 00:14:12,270
And

307
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:15,240
Madam Xu is only a mistress.

308
00:14:16,030 --> 00:14:17,270
Why would she be staying at Yun Mansion?

309
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,160
I know.

310
00:14:20,430 --> 00:14:22,010
She must be Yun Qi's concubine.

311
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,760
Madam Xu is so beautiful and kind.

312
00:14:26,670 --> 00:14:29,160
Being his concubine must be miserable.

313
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:32,030
And he even tried to kill her.

314
00:14:32,890 --> 00:14:34,200
Yun Qi is a such a jerk.

315
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:37,120
With that wit of yours,

316
00:14:37,330 --> 00:14:38,170
you're hopeless.

317
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:41,580
How many children do the Yuns have?

318
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,360
Three in all.

319
00:14:45,490 --> 00:14:46,390
The eldest son, Yun Qi.

320
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:47,620
The elder daughter, Yun Heng.

321
00:14:48,670 --> 00:14:49,120
Right.

322
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,000
You met her at the Noble Consort's.

323
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,560
She tried to match you two.

324
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:54,820
And the younger daughter, Yun Shao.

325
00:14:55,460 --> 00:14:56,470
She's been frail since childhood.

326
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,500
Hardly ever leaves home.

327
00:14:58,500 --> 00:14:59,270
A breeze could knock her over.

328
00:15:00,550 --> 00:15:03,910
I hear she's very delicate.

329
00:15:04,210 --> 00:15:05,220
Delicate?

330
00:15:11,830 --> 00:15:13,190
Do you mean to say

331
00:15:14,970 --> 00:15:16,340
she is the Yun family's second lady?

332
00:15:16,740 --> 00:15:17,250
Impossible.

333
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,550
Madam Xu isn't like that.

334
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:24,740
And I saw how she looked at Yun Qi.

335
00:15:25,790 --> 00:15:28,360
It's full of love and hate.

336
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:29,970
So much resentment.

337
00:15:31,450 --> 00:15:33,020
You know what resentment looks like?

338
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:37,270
Women who can't have you

339
00:15:37,470 --> 00:15:38,480
look at you

340
00:15:39,550 --> 00:15:40,230
the same way.

341
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:43,900
Give me back.

342
00:15:50,870 --> 00:15:51,280
Sir.

343
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,490
I also find it hard to believe.

344
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:55,480
But I've heard a story.

345
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,220
What story?

346
00:15:58,670 --> 00:15:59,670
One day, the Yun Mansion held a banquet.

347
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,150
Several ladies in the garden

348
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:02,240
saw the younger Lady Yun.

349
00:16:02,530 --> 00:16:03,660
They only raised their voices a little,

350
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:06,450
yet she fainted.

351
00:16:09,610 --> 00:16:10,020
Here.

352
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,640
Who is that young lady?

353
00:16:18,030 --> 00:16:19,340
I fainted from hunger.

354
00:16:20,310 --> 00:16:21,340
If Ruoming's right,

355
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:23,600
and she really is the younger Lady Yun,

356
00:16:25,750 --> 00:16:26,890
why would Yun Qi try to kill her?

357
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:29,440
She's his sister.

358
00:16:33,330 --> 00:16:33,630
Right.

359
00:16:34,530 --> 00:16:35,100
Ruoming, Chang'an,

360
00:16:35,810 --> 00:16:37,020
you must protect Madam Xu.

361
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:39,560
Don't let her get hurt again.

362
00:16:41,090 --> 00:16:43,080
She matters most to Lord Pei now.

363
00:16:55,260 --> 00:16:56,270
Madam Xu?

364
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:57,910
We're discussing official business.

365
00:16:58,210 --> 00:16:59,790
Eavesdroppers get twenty lashes.

366
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:03,580
Sir, I wasn't eavesdropping.

367
00:17:04,810 --> 00:17:06,130
I came to bring you something.

368
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:07,920
If you love doing needlework,

369
00:17:08,450 --> 00:17:09,570
go work at an embroidery shop.

370
00:17:10,290 --> 00:17:11,590
You've all taken good care of me.

371
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:12,760
I'm truly grateful.

372
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,480
I don't have much to offer

373
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,440
in return,

374
00:17:15,700 --> 00:17:16,900
but I can make a few little things

375
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:17,740
to show my gratitude.

376
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:21,640
If you don't like it,
you don't have to take it.

377
00:17:21,890 --> 00:17:24,070
Sir, Madam Xu means well.

378
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,240
Get back to work.

379
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:27,240
Yes, sir.

380
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:29,340
Bye.

381
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:34,750
Sir.

382
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,170
If you want to investigate Chen Daohua,

383
00:17:37,890 --> 00:17:38,530
I have a way.

384
00:17:40,750 --> 00:17:42,030
Remember every word I say.

385
00:17:42,570 --> 00:17:44,690
If you want to stay, follow the rules.

386
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:46,680
Don't ask what you shouldn't.

387
00:17:56,510 --> 00:17:57,310
Lu Li?

388
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:01,200
Sir.

389
00:18:02,110 --> 00:18:02,730
What are you doing here?

390
00:18:03,610 --> 00:18:04,370
It's time for training.

391
00:18:05,090 --> 00:18:06,220
I came to get Madam Xu.

392
00:18:06,730 --> 00:18:08,250
Her affairs concern you now?

393
00:18:10,670 --> 00:18:11,200
No, sir.

394
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:12,720
Didn't you say

395
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:13,790
Madam Xu should join us

396
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:14,800
during Fengyi Guard training

397
00:18:15,110 --> 00:18:16,050
so she could practice more?

398
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,470
Don't call her again.

399
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:21,270
Why not?

400
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,200
Give this to her.

401
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,790
Tell her

402
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,310
to drop those little schemes.

403
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,560
Drop those little schemes?

404
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:46,530
Madam Xu?

405
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:49,600
Madam Xu?

406
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:51,380
Lord Lu.

407
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:52,510
What brings you here?

408
00:18:53,180 --> 00:18:53,730
Madam Xu,

409
00:18:54,260 --> 00:18:56,050
Lord Pei asked me to give you the money.

410
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:57,600
He hopes

411
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,280
you won't make these things anymore.

412
00:19:00,530 --> 00:19:01,310
I don't need it.

413
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:02,500
I still owe him money.

414
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:05,860
Take it.

415
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:12,420
Lord Lu,

416
00:19:13,030 --> 00:19:14,030
may I ask you something?

417
00:19:28,060 --> 00:19:30,870
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

418
00:19:32,490 --> 00:19:35,680
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

419
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,740
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

420
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:43,680
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

421
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:48,510
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

422
00:19:49,730 --> 00:19:54,740
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

423
00:19:55,060 --> 00:20:03,090
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

424
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:11,980
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

425
00:20:11,980 --> 00:20:20,650
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

426
00:20:21,030 --> 00:20:29,900
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

427
00:20:30,330 --> 00:20:38,820
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
